        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilkulikae tung'ana, ilapolosak, o Lawi, o larripok le kishomi, o laranyak, o laisiaayiak le nkaji e Nkai, o lelo pooki ooitekeputua ate aaitalam iloreren le nena kuapi, aaibelekenyakino nkitanapat e Nkai, tenebo inkituaak enye, o layiok lenye, o ntoyie enye, lelo pooki oata engeno o eyiolounoto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neibung'are ilalashera lenye, o lkituaak lenye, nejing ninche oldeket, o lmumai pee eibung nkitanapat e Nkai apa naaishoruaki aaimunye Musa osinka le Nkai. Pee esipu neas nkitanapat pooki o Laitoriani, Olaitoriani lang, o nkikoot enyena o nkiguanat enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
