        {
          "text": " naa teneyau iltung'ana lena kop ntokitin naamiri o entapa e pooki pukunoto te nkolong e sabato pee emir, nimikinyiang'u iyiook te ninche, te nkolong e sabato anaa te nkolong sinyati; nimikitur iyiook nkurman to lari liopishana, nikipalaa pooki sile.",
